00:24:11.757 --> 00:24:14.137
When the phone rang, and the guy'd say,

00:24:14.137 --> 00:24:16.840
"Well, your package didn't
come, Mr. Sterling."

00:24:16.840 --> 00:24:19.060
That means the jeweler wasn't there.

00:24:19.060 --> 00:24:23.310
