00:24:40.180 --> 00:24:43.673
which was in the basement, you
know, a subway, I should say.

00:24:44.550 --> 00:24:47.840
So we took the, we took the
elevator up to the third floor,

00:24:47.840 --> 00:24:51.610
walked two flights up, took
the elevator up another flight,

00:24:51.610 --> 00:24:53.610
