01:05:27.640 --> 01:05:32.640
Republicans and Democrats
alike, big liars, all of 'em.

01:05:34.290 --> 01:05:36.707
We were saints compared to these people.

01:05:37.750 --> 01:05:40.090
The only thing is they didn't kill people,

01:05:40.090 --> 01:05:42.227
but they kill 'em another way.

01:05:42.227 --> 01:05:44.549
- [Mark] Yeah. (both laughing)

01:05:44.549 --> 01:05:46.361
- Anyway, I thought I'd throw that out.

01:05:46.361 --> 01:05:47.490
